  "prefLabel": "He-C 210.01 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 210.01 Scope. Unless otherwise specified, He-C 210 shall apply to the procurement of goods and services by the New Hampshire department of health and human services through a request for bid (RFB), request for application (RFA), or a request for proposal (RFP), or through a similar invitation.\n\nSource. #12051, eff 11-19-16",
